{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_cec186c56cdb42bc83c97ccdedfe2c8f","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No nodeId was provided. Listing the top-level pages of the document. Call get_metadata again with one of the page ids below (or any node id underneath) to get the XML metadata for that subtree.\n\nTop-level pages of the document:\n- 0:1: 00 · Start Here 设计任务\n- 1:2: 01 · Foundations 视觉规范\n- 1:3: 02 · Components 组件库\n- 1:4: 04 · Media 素材库\n- 5:2: 03 · Workspace"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cda7a16c-453d-4dc3-870a-25e4b7be3132","uuid":"ce933bd2-6892-4e02-a726-9f6ace65a086","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:09:24.220Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"No nodeId was provided. Listing the top-level pages of the document. Call get_metadata again with one of the page ids below (or any node id underneath) to get the XML metadata for that subtree.\n\nTop-level pages of the document:\n- 0:1: 00 · Start Here 设计任务\n- 1:2: 01 · Foundations 视觉规范\n- 1:3: 02 · Components 组件库\n- 1:4: 04 · Media 素材库\n- 5:2: 03 · Workspace"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"37630794-1dc3-44f1-9549-5a0f3205f2cd"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_cec186c56cdb42bc83c97ccdedfe2c8f","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610302009243901950758268d9d6zI0DMtBB","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_f81e133f03a0453baf452dca90e053c4","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  const pages = figma.root.children;\n  const result = [];\n  for (const page of pages) {\n    result.push({ id: page.id, name: page.name });\n  }\n  \n  // Find \"00 · Start Here\" page\n  const startHerePage = pages.find(p => p.name.includes(\"00\"));\n  let startHereText = [];\n  if (startHerePage) {\n    await startHerePage.loadAsync();\n    const textNodes = startHerePage.findAll(node => node.type === \"TEXT\");\n    for (const t of textNodes) {\n      startHereText.push({ name: t.name, characters: t.characters });\n    }\n  }\n\n  return { pages: result, startHereText };\n})()","description":"Read pages and text content from 00 · Start Here","fileKey":"jiYwYdVVeh1sSSwCPVx5uG"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10785,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":8226},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cda7a16c-453d-4dc3-870a-25e4b7be3132","uuid":"0720ae36-a98f-49c9-b3ba-50091b259c6a","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:09:28.719Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_f81e133f03a0453baf452dca90e053c4","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_f81e133f03a0453baf452dca90e053c4","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"pages\":[{\"id\":\"0:1\",\"name\":\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\"},{\"id\":\"1:2\",\"name\":\"01 · Foundations 视觉规范\"},{\"id\":\"1:3\",\"name\":\"02 · Components 组件库\"},{\"id\":\"1:4\",\"name\":\"04 · Media 素材库\"},{\"id\":\"5:2\",\"name\":\"03 · Workspace\"}],\"startHereText\":[{\"name\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"characters\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\"},{\"name\":\"Fruit Hub — fruit salad ordering app\",\"characters\":\"Fruit Hub — fruit salad ordering app\"},{\"name\":\"Design the complete Fruit Hub mobile app: Tony tells the app their first name, browses fruit salad combos, adds one to the basket, checks out with delivery details or a card, and tracks the delivery. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"characters\":\"Design the complete Fruit Hub mobile app: Tony tells the app their first name, browses fruit salad combos, adds one to the basket, checks out with delivery details or a card, and tracks the delivery.\\nCanvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\"},{\"name\":\"How to work\",\"characters\":\"How to work\"},{\"name\":\"1. Build exactly the 10 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, supporting colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the sheets and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, product photos, illustrations, map and icons from 04 · Media. Prices use the Naira glyph (Icon_Naira or “₦”). 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"characters\":\"1. Build exactly the 10 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, supporting colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the sheets and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use the logo, product photos, illustrations, map and icons from 04 · Media. Prices use the Naira glyph (Icon_Naira or “₦”).\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\"},{\"name\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"characters\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\"},{\"name\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"characters\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\"},{\"name\":\"01_Splash\",\"characters\":\"01_Splash\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Brand recognition while the app loads.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Brand recognition while the app loads.\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"name\":\"• Brand: Logo_Fruit_Hub\",\"characters\":\"• Brand: Logo_Fruit_Hub\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\"},{\"name\":\"→ auto → 02_Welcome\",\"characters\":\"→ auto → 02_Welcome\"},{\"name\":\"02_Welcome\",\"characters\":\"02_Welcome\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Explain the offer and start.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Explain the offer and start.\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"name\":\"• Actions: Let’s Continue • Copy: “Get The Freshest Fruit Salad Combo” · “We deliver the best and freshest fruit salad in town. Order for a combo today!!!” • Media: Basket_Welcome · Fruit_Drops\",\"characters\":\"• Actions: Let’s Continue\\n• Copy: “Get The Freshest Fruit Salad Combo” · “We deliver the best and freshest fruit salad in town. Order for a combo today!!!”\\n• Media: Basket_Welcome · Fruit_Drops\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\"},{\"name\":\"→ Let’s Continue → 03_Name\",\"characters\":\"→ Let’s Continue → 03_Name\"},{\"name\":\"03_Name\",\"characters\":\"03_Name\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Tell the app your first name.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Tell the app your first name.\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"name\":\"• Actions: Start Ordering • Copy: “What is your firstname?” • Form: first name, entered “Tony” • Media: Basket_Name · Fruit_Drops\",\"characters\":\"• Actions: Start Ordering\\n• Copy: “What is your firstname?”\\n• Form: first name, entered “Tony”\\n• Media: Basket_Name · Fruit_Drops\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\"},{\"name\":\"→ Start Ordering → 04_Home\",\"characters\":\"→ Start Ordering → 04_Home\"},{\"name\":\"04_Home\",\"characters\":\"04_Home\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Find a fruit salad combo.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Find a fruit salad combo.\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"name\":\"• Account: “Hello Tony, What fruit salad combo do you want today?” · menu entry · My basket entry • Categories: Hottest / Popular / New combo / Top · current: Hottest • Hottest: Quinoa fruit salad · Tropical fruit salad · Melon fruit salad, each with photo, name, price, favourite toggle and add to basket • Recommended: “Recommended Combo” · Honey lime combo · Berry mango combo, each with photo, name, price, favourite toggle and add to basket • Search & filter: search “Search for fruit salad combos” · filter entry\",\"characters\":\"• Account: “Hello Tony, What fruit salad combo do you want today?” · menu entry · My basket entry\\n• Categories: Hottest / Popular / New combo / Top · current: Hottest\\n• Hottest: Quinoa fruit salad · Tropical fruit salad · Melon fruit salad, each with photo, name, price, favourite toggle and add to basket\\n• Recommended: “Recommended Combo” · Honey lime combo · Berry mango combo, each with photo, name, price, favourite toggle and add to basket\\n• Search & filter: search “Search for fruit salad combos” · filter entry\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\"},{\"name\":\"→ Quinoa fruit salad → 05_Product_Quinoa → My basket → 06_Basket\",\"characters\":\"→ Quinoa fruit salad → 05_Product_Quinoa\\n→ My basket → 06_Basket\"},{\"name\":\"05_Product_Quinoa\",\"characters\":\"05_Product_Quinoa\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Choose a quantity and add the combo to the basket.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Choose a quantity and add the combo to the basket.\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"name\":\"• Actions: Go back · favourite toggle · Add to basket • Contents: “One Pack Contains:” · Red Quinoa, Lime, Honey, Blueberries, Strawberries, Mango, Fresh mint. • Copy: “Quinoa Fruit Salad” · “If you are looking for a new fruit salad to eat today,