},{\"name\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\",\"characters\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\"},{\"name\":\"Fixed (given)\",\"characters\":\"Fixed (given)\"},{\"name\":\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color #FFA451 + Nunito • Media: logo, product photos, illustrations, map, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\",\"characters\":\"• Frame list and exact names\\n• Must-include content per frame (what, not how)\\n• Navigation structure and links\\n• All data and copy\\n• Brand primary color #FFA451 + Nunito\\n• Media: logo, product photos, illustrations, map, icons\\n• Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\"},{\"name\":\"Yours (designer decides)\",\"characters\":\"Yours (designer decides)\"},{\"name\":\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic and supporting colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: selected, favourited, pressed, disabled, filled, done / current / pending • Headers, sheets and all business components • How the step progress and the map are presented\",\"characters\":\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen\\n• All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic and supporting colors\\n• Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation\\n• All states: selected, favourited, pressed, disabled, filled, done / current / pending\\n• Headers, sheets and all business components\\n• How the step progress and the map are presented\"},{\"name\":\"How it is evaluated\",\"characters\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"name\":\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\",\"characters\":\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\"},{\"name\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Flow & prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current category, filled fields, sheet over basket, done / current / pending steps)\",\"characters\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame\\n2. Data & copy accuracy\\n3. Flow & prototype completeness\\n4. Information hierarchy\\n5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system\\n6. Component reuse\\n7. State design (current category, filled fields, sheet over basket, done / current / pending steps)\"},{\"name\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 10 named frames, your components and the prototype.\",\"characters\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 10 named frames, your components and the prototype.\"}]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cda7a16c-453d-4dc3-870a-25e4b7be3132","uuid":"2c66568a-5e41-4882-836e-28d399038562","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:09:30.992Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"pages\":[{\"id\":\"0:1\",\"name\":\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\"},{\"id\":\"1:2\",\"name\":\"01 · Foundations 视觉规范\"},{\"id\":\"1:3\",\"name\":\"02 · Components 组件库\"},{\"id\":\"1:4\",\"name\":\"04 · Media 素材库\"},{\"id\":\"5:2\",\"name\":\"03 · Workspace\"}],\"startHereText\":[{\"name\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"characters\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\"},{\"name\":\"Fruit Hub — fruit salad ordering app\",\"characters\":\"Fruit Hub — fruit salad ordering app\"},{\"name\":\"Design the complete Fruit Hub mobile app: Tony tells the app their first name, browses fruit salad combos, adds one to the basket, checks out with delivery details or a card, and tracks the delivery. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"characters\":\"Design the complete Fruit Hub mobile app: Tony tells the app their first name, browses fruit salad combos, adds one to the basket, checks out with delivery details or a card, and tracks the delivery.\\nCanvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\"},{\"name\":\"How to work\",\"characters\":\"How to work\"},{\"name\":\"1. Build exactly the 10 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, supporting colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the sheets and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, product photos, illustrations, map and icons from 04 · Media. Prices use the Naira glyph (Icon_Naira or “₦”). 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"characters\":\"1. Build exactly the 10 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, supporting colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the sheets and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use the logo, product photos, illustrations, map and icons from 04 · Media. Prices use the Naira glyph (Icon_Naira or “₦”).\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\"},{\"name\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"characters\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\"},{\"name\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"characters\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\"},{\"name\":\"01_Splash\",\"characters\":\"01_Splash\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Brand recognition while the app loads.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Brand recognition while the app loads.\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"name\":\"• Brand: Logo_Fruit_Hub\",\"characters\":\"• Brand: Logo_Fruit_Hub\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\"},{\"name\":\"→ auto → 02_Welcome\",\"characters\":\"→ auto → 02_Welcome\"},{\"name\":\"02_Welcome\",\"characters\":\"02_Welcome\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Explain the offer and start.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Explain the offer and start.\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"name\":\"• Actions: Let’s Continue • Copy: “Get The Freshest Fruit Salad Combo” · “We deliver the best and freshest fruit salad in town. Order for a combo today!!!” • Media: Basket_Welcome · Fruit_Drops\",\"characters\":\"• Actions: Let’s Continue\\n• Copy: “Get The Freshest Fruit Salad Combo” · “We deliver the best and freshest fruit salad in town. Order for a combo today!