eets and all business components • How the step progress and the map are presented\",\"characters\":\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen\\n• All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic and supporting colors\\n• Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation\\n• All states: selected, favourited, pressed, disabled, filled, done / current / pending\\n• Headers, sheets and all business components\\n• How the step progress and the map are presented\"},{\"name\":\"How it is evaluated\",\"characters\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"name\":\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\",\"characters\":\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\"},{\"name\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Flow & prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current category, filled fields, sheet over basket, done / current / pending steps)\",\"characters\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame\\n2. Data & copy accuracy\\n3. Flow & prototype completeness\\n4. Information hierarchy\\n5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system\\n6. Component reuse\\n7. State design (current category, filled fields, sheet over basket, done / current / pending steps)\"},{\"name\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 10 named frames, your components and the prototype.\",\"characters\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 10 named frames, your components and the prototype.\"}]}"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"97ac090a-2e00-4793-ac08-8cd49c4dc547"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_f81e133f03a0453baf452dca90e053c4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610302009311614905008268d9d6Ndz3RZGg","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_798c72caf73e4fb4bc8f749436f995d1","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  const pages = figma.root.children;\n  \n  async function inspectPage(pageName) {\n    const page = pages.find(p => p.name.includes(pageName));\n    if (!page) return null;\n    await page.loadAsync();\n    \n    const nodes = page.children.map(c => ({\n      id: c.id,\n      name: c.name,\n      type: c.type,\n      width: c.width,\n      height: c.height,\n      children: c.children ? c.children.map(ch => ({ id: ch.id, name: ch.name, type: ch.type })) : []\n    }));\n    return nodes;\n  }\n\n  const foundations = await inspectPage(\"01\");\n  const components = await inspectPage(\"02\");\n  const media = await inspectPage(\"04\");\n\n  return { foundations, components, media };\n})()","description":"Inspect Foundations, Components, and Media pages","fileKey":"jiYwYdVVeh1sSSwCPVx5uG"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":16431,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":10803},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cda7a16c-453d-4dc3-870a-25e4b7be3132","uuid":"424355a9-2273-4b91-b471-1bfc48ffc3d0","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:09:35.648Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_798c72caf73e4fb4bc8f749436f995d1","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_798c72caf73e4fb4bc8f749436f995d1","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"foundations\":[{\"id\":\"3:2\",\"name\":\"Foundations\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":797,\"children\":[{\"id\":\"3:3\",\"name\":\"Foundations · Fruit Hub\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:4\",\"name\":\"Fixed: the brand primary color and the typeface below — they carry the Fruit Hub identity. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, surfaces and backgrounds, semantic colors (success, error, warning, disabled), supporting colors, type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:5\",\"name\":\"Brand color\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:6\",\"name\":\"Brand primary\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"},{\"id\":\"3:11\",\"name\":\"Typeface\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:12\",\"name\":\"Type samples\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"},{\"id\":\"3:19\",\"name\":\"Use Nunito for all UI text (replaces the source’s Brandon Grotesque, which is not available). Bad Script appears only inside the supplied Logo_Fruit_Hub — do not use it elsewhere. Sizes, weights and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale.\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:20\",\"name\":\"Canvas: 375 × 812 (iPhone). Light mode only. Currency: Nigerian Naira (₦, glyph supplied as Icon_Naira).\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"}]}],\"components\":[{\"id\":\"3:21\",\"name\":\"Components\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":571,\"children\":[{\"id\":\"3:22\",\"name\":\"Components · Fruit Hub (default states only)\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:23\",\"name\":\"Only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell are given. Every other state (pressed, disabled, focused, filled, selected…), the headers, sheets and every business component (product cards, basket rows, steppers, status steps…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:24\",\"name\":\"Button · default\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:25\",\"name\":\"Button\",\"type\":\"COMPONENT\"},{\"id\":\"3:27\",\"name\":\"Text Field · default\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:28\",\"name\":\"Text Field\",\"type\":\"COMPONENT\"},{\"id\":\"3:30\",\"name\":\"Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated)\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:31\",\"name\":\"iOS status bar and home indicator, 375 wide. Place them on every frame; they are not part of your design.\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:44\",\"name\":\"Shell\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"}]}],\"media\":[{\"id\":\"2:2\",\"name\":\"Media\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1679,\"children\":[{\"id\":\"2:3\",\"name\":\"FRUIT HUB / MEDIA\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"2:4\",\"name\":\"Logo, product photos, illustrations and icons. Copy what you need into your own file. Icons may be recolored; do not redraw brand assets.\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"2:5\",\"name\":\"01  BRAND\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"},{\"id\":\"2:11\",\"name\":\"02  PRODUCT PHOTOS (fruit salad combos)\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"},{\"id\":\"2:29\",\"name\":\"03  ILLUSTRATIONS\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"},{\"id\":\"2:53\",\"name\":\"04  ICONS\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"}]}]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cda7a16c-453d-4dc3-870a-25e4b7be3132","uuid":"71c2c884-b1c1-4842-a0d8-d9c9fed75a41","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:09:37.513Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"foundations\":[{\"id\":\"3:2\",\"name\":\"Foundations\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":797,\"children\":[{\"id\":\"3:3\",\"name\":\"Foundations · Fruit Hub\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:4\",\"name\":\"Fixed: the brand primary color and the typeface below — they carry the Fruit Hub identity. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, surfaces and backgrounds, semantic colors (success, error, warning, disabled), supporting colors, type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:5\",\"name\":\"Brand color\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:6\",\"name\":\"Brand primary\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"},{\"id\":\"3:11\",\"name\":\"Typeface\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:12\",\"name\":\"Type samples\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"},{\"id\":\"3:19\",\"name\":\"Use Nunito for all UI text (replaces the source’s Brandon Grotesque, which is not available). Bad Script appears only inside the supplied Logo_Fruit_Hub — do not use it elsewhere. Sizes, weights and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale.\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:20\",\"name\":\"Canvas: 375 × 812 (iPhone). Light mode only. Currency: Nigerian Naira (₦, glyph supplied as Icon_Naira).\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"}]}],\"components\":[{\"id\":\"3:21\",\"name\":\"Components\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":571,\"children\":[{\"id\":\"3:22\",\"name\":\"Components · Fruit Hub (default states only)\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:23\",\"name\":\"Only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell are given. Every other state (pressed, disabled, focused, filled, selected…), the headers, sheets and every business component (product cards, basket rows, steppers, status steps…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:24\",\"name\":\"Button · default\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:25\",\"name\":\"Button\",\"type\":\"COMPONENT\"},{\"id\":\"3:27\",\"name\":\"Text Field · default\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:28\",\"name\":\"Text Field\",\"type\":\"COMPONENT\"},{\"id\":\"3:30\",\"name\":\"Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated)\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:31\",\"name\":\"iOS status bar and home indicator, 375 wide. Place them on every frame; they are not part of your design.\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"3:44\",\"name\":\"Shell\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"}]}],\"media\":[{\"id\":\"2:2\",\"name\":\"Media\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1679,\"children\":[{\"id\":\"2:3\",\"name\":\"FRUIT HUB / MEDIA\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"2:4\",\"name\":\"Logo, product photos, illustrations and icons. Copy what you need into your own file. Icons may be recolored; do not redraw brand assets.\",\"type\":\"TEXT\"},{\"id\":\"2:5\",\"name\":\"01  BRAND\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"},{\"id\":\"2:11\",\"name\":\"02  PRODUCT PHOTOS (fruit salad combos)\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"},{\"id\":\"2:29\",\"name\":\"03  ILLUSTRATIONS\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"},{\"id\":\"2:53\",\"name\":\"04  ICONS\",\"type\":\"FRAME\"}]}]}"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"ee082d8f-2c34-4f5b-aa2b-d9c066b1287b"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_798c72caf73e4fb4bc8f749436f995d1","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610302009378855375828268d9d6mci3bHel","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_2275f0dd6a0a4e4b90bf3af8fb48f526","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  async function getChildrenOf(parentId) {\n    const node = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(parentId);\n    if (!node || !node.children) return [];\n    return node.children.map(c => ({\n      id: c.id,\n      name: c.name,\n      type: c.type,\n      width: c.width,\n      height: c.height\n    }));\n  }\n\n  // Brand children (2:5)\n  const brand = await getChildrenOf(\"2:5\");\n  // Product photos children (2:11)\n  const products = await getChildrenOf(\"2:11\");\n  // Illustrations (2:29)\n  const illustrations = await getChildrenOf(\"2:29\");\n  // Icons (2:53)\n  const icons = await getChildrenOf(\"2:53\");\n\n  // Also get the colors / properties of foundations brand primary color to be exact\n  const brandPrimaryNode = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"3:6\");\n  let brandPrimaryColor = null;\n  if (brandPrimaryNode && brandPrimaryNode.fills) {\n    brandPrimaryColor = brandPrimaryNode.fills;\n  }\n\n  return { brand, products, illustrations, icons, brandPrimaryColor };\n})()","description":"Get child layers from Media frames and inspect brand primary color fill","fileKey":"jiYwYdVVeh1sSSwCPVx5uG"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":17180,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cda7a16c-453d-4dc3-870a-25e4b7be3132","uuid":"ab270b5c-40f0-4bf3-bd1c-58b06b5d8a2f","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:09:43.316Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_2275f0dd6a0a4e4b90bf3af8fb48f526","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
